; Co-op body damage multipliers. Calibrated so an ordinary rifle (AK-74 5.45 FMJ,
; hit_power ~0.9 * k_hit ~0.35 = ~0.31 raw) drops an unarmored torso in ~3 hits
; and a headshot is decisively lethal. Limb hits are survivable but stack quickly.
